WEBVTT

53:00.460 --> 53:03.337
So you see we're friends now, guys.
Aren't we, Buzz?

53:03.421 --> 53:05.339
You bet. Give me a hug.

53:06.466 --> 53:07.883
Boy, I love you too.

53:07.968 --> 53:09.552
See? It is Buzz.

53:09.636 --> 53:11.262
Now give back the lights,
Potato Head.

53:11.346 --> 53:12.805
Wait just a minute.

53:12.889 --> 53:15.432
-What are you tryin' to pull?
-Nothing!

53:19.437 --> 53:21.480
-Oh, that is disgusting.
-Murderer!

53:21.565 --> 53:23.649
-No! No, no, no, no, no!
-You murdering dog!

53:23.733 --> 53:26.068
-It's not what you think. I swear!
-Save it for the jury.

53:26.152 --> 53:28.737
I hope Sid pulls
your voice box out, ya creep.

53:28.822 --> 53:30.739
No, no! No, no!
Don't leave! Don't leave!
